<title>USA: Groupe Schneider promotes U.S. executives.</title>
<headline>Groupe Schneider promotes U.S. executives.</headline>
<dateline>PALATINE, Ill. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groupe Schneider of France, which merged in 1991 with Square D Co, said Thursday it named Charles Denny to the position of chairman and chief executive officer of Schneider North America, a newly created post. Denny has been president and CEO of Schneider North America and president and chief operating officer of Square D.</p>
<p>In addition, the company promoted Chris Richardson to president and chief operating officer of both Square D and Schneider North America.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
